// peeph.def:1952: common peephole 120 removed loads by exploiting commutativity of addition.
// if notUsed('bc')
rule peeph-1952
    for: v2 in a | b | c | d | e | h | l | bc | de | hl | sp | af | (hl) | (de) | (bc) | ix | iy | #k2 | (k2) | o2 (ix) | o2 (iy)
